   "subject": "Can I call a function when stoping Shiny?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Is there any similar function like unload or unattach got called when I exit shiny apps?<div><br></div><div>The thing is this: A colleague of mine created a Shiny app, which can connect to the database and do some work. However, after he presses Ctrl+c to exit Shiny, he wants to automatically call the database disconnect function to stop the connection. Otherwise, the connection is still there and not closed.</div><div><br></div><div>Is there any way to do that?</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "6uIC66rwmy8J",
   "from": "Jeff Allen",
   "author": "bbc57ffa8a14ad13",
   "date": "2014-01-24T20:51:11Z",
   "subject": "Re: Can I call a function when stoping Shiny?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I may be ignorant of the good way to do this, so maybe somebody else can chime in if this is already built in.<div><br></div><div>But one option would be to leverage the session$onSessionEnded feature (a la <a href=\"https://github.com/trestletech/ShinyChat/blob/master/server.R#L30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/trestletech/ShinyChat/blob/master/server.R%23L30&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792405136254000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2sk3yBY5J2Jaoc1PFw6rUl\">https://github.com/trestletech/ShinyChat/blob/master/server.R#L30</a>) which defines a function that executes when a *session* ends. Obviously, you would have to define a bit of a wrapper around this to figure out whether or not the *application* should be disconnected.</div><div><br></div><div>But perhaps something like this would get the job done in server.R (pardon any syntax errors, I&#39;m just eyeballing this)</div><div><br></div><div>## server.R</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">vals &lt;- reactiveValues(sessions = 0, connection = NULL)</span><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">shinyServer</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">function</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">input</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\"> output</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\"> session</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">{</span></div><div>  observe({</div><div>    # This observer will get executed once on session startup, so increment</div><div>    isolate({</div><div>      vals$sessions &lt;- vals$sessions + 1</div><div>    })</div><div>  })</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px;background-color:rgb(255,255,204)\">session<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">$</span>onSessionEnded<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:bold\">function</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">()</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">{</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\">    isolate<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">({</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\">      # This will get executed when a session exits</div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\">      vals$sessions &lt;- vals$sessions - 1</div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\">    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">})</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">  })</span></div></pre></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">  </span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">    observe({</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">      # This just takes a reactive dependency on vals$session, so when that number</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">      # changes this function will execute. If sessions is now 0, disconnect. If it&#39;s</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">      # non-zero, make sure we&#39;re connected</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">      if (vals$sessions == 0){</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">        if (!is.null(vals$connection)){</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">          # We have a connection but no sessions, disconnect.</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">          disconnect()</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">          vals$connection &lt;- NULL</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">        }</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">      } else {</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">        </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">if (is.null(vals$connection)){</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">          # We have a session but no connection, open the connection </span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">          vals$connection &lt;- openConnection()</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">        }</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">      }</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">    })</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\">})</span></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Thursday, January 23, 2014 5:42:17 PM UTC-6, Walking Sparrow wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Is there any similar function like unload or unattach got called when I exit shiny apps?<div><br></div><div>The thing is this: A colleague of mine created a Shiny app, which can connect to the database and do some work. However, after he presses Ctrl+c to exit Shiny, he wants to automatically call the database disconnect function to stop the connection. Otherwise, the connection is still there and not closed.</div><div><br></div><div>Is there any way to do that?</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
