     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Oops. Wrap any reference to session$vals in an isolate({}) chunk in that last observer. Otherwise that observer will take a dependency on session$vals. Otherwise it will continually update itself.<div><br></div><div>But hopefully the general idea comes through. I think this would be a scalable solution for you whether you&#39;re running it locally like you are now or even if you wanted to deploy this on Shiny Server someday.</div><div><br></div><div>Jeff</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Thursday, January 23, 2014 5:42:17 PM UTC-6, Walking Sparrow wrote:</div></div>"
    ],
